---
import ProductLayout from '../layouts/ProductLayout.astro';
import { products } from '../data/products';
---

<ProductLayout product={products[2]}>
  <h2 id="about-title">Made to travel</h2>
  <p>Designed and built from scratch by Vertex Luthier Noah Connell, this 3D-printed electric cello combines a minimalist body with a lightweight carbon fiber endpin for a compact, performance-ready instrument.</p>
  <h2>Packs down to carry-on size</h2>
  <p>The entire cello breaks down into the included hard-shell case, measuring 22 &times; 13.2 &times; 8 inches (56 &times; 33.5 &times; 20 cm). Check your airline's current carry-on limits before travelling.</p>
  <h2>Built to protect</h2>
  <p>The case has a hard aluminum alloy exterior and an impact-absorbing foam-lined interior to cushion your instrument in transit.</p>
  <h2>Assembles in minutes</h2>
  <p>Setup and teardown each take about 5 to 8 minutes. Sections slide and fasten together with no special tools required. Assembly instructions and videos are available.</p>
  <h2>Plug in and play</h2>
  <p>A piezo pickup under the bridge captures your tone, while the onboard preamp connects to a bass amp or headphone amp. A headphone amp and headphones (not included) allow quiet practice. You can also practice unplugged.</p>
  <h2>Designed and built from scratch</h2>
  <p>Structural components are custom designed, 3D printed in durable PETG, and reinforced for long-term stability. Bass guitar tuners offer precise tuning; the carbon fiber endpin adjusts to your playing height. Every part is designed, printed, and assembled by hand.</p>
  <h2>What is included</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Custom 3D-printed electric cello, fully strung and ready to unpack, tune, and play</li>
    <li>Hard-shell aluminum alloy carrying case with foam interior</li>
    <li>Carbon fiber endpin</li>
    <li>Assembly instructions and videos available</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Bow and amp are not included. Any standard cello bow works.</p>
  <h2>Looking for something custom?</h2>
  <p>Message us on Etsy with questions or ideas for a completely custom electric cello. From dragons to puppies, playful to intense, we can match your style.</p>
</ProductLayout>
